('Chief Data Officer', 'chief-data-officer', 'Chief Data Officer – New Seat in C-suiteAs an analytics professional, it is really heartening to see the birth of terms such as Chief Data Officer and Ch', '<p>Chief Data Officer – New Seat in C-suite</p>
<p>As an analytics professional, it is really heartening to see the birth of terms such as Chief Data Officer and Chief Analytics Officer. I bet you must have never came such terms in your whole lifetime.</p>
<p>You might have heard a few or all of the following:</p>
<ul>
