<p>It’s evident that outlier capping was useful and effective, as several outliers previously had data that are now gone.</p>
<h4>03.3. Visualization</h4>
<p>As the data is free of missing values and outliers and has proper data types, we can perform some advanced EDA by visualizing it.</p>
<p>We create a histogram for the numerical columns to understand their distribution.</p>
<p><code>df_clean.hist(figsize=(20, 20), grid=False, density=True)   plt.show()</code></p>
<ul>
<li>OUTPUT:</li>
</ul>
