('How to Perform Data Analysis using Python - A Case Study With Sales Data [Codes Included]', 'data-analytics-with-python', 'Data Analytics with Python: Learn essential techniques & best practices to enhance your data-driven decision-making with our guide.', '<p>Data analysis refers to discovering insights from the data that help draw meaningful conclusions and aid decision-making. As organizations increasingly rely on data-backed decision-making, the need for data analysts is on the rise.</p>
